  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for strengthening training policies and plans in educational systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity is aimed at supporting:
&#x2022; The transformation of the policy, the management and governance system, monitoring and evaluation, as well as the formulation and reform of the National Education Plan in the Dominican Republic for the period 2024-2034.
&#x2022; The training of Dominican policymakers, to strengthen their capacities in the direction and evaluation of educational transformation processes.
&#x2022; The participation of Cuba, Dominican Republic and Venezuela in international evaluation processes on the learning results in their training plans.</narrative>
  </description>
